# Enterprise Branch Network Topology

## Overview

This was my first Cisco Packet Tracer lab.

The purpose of the lab was to create a basic enterprise network diagram connecting a New York branch and a Tokyo branch through a simulated internet connection.

The topology includes computers, servers, switches, routers, firewalls, and an external attacker device.

This version of the lab focuses on network design and understanding where common network devices are positioned. IP addressing, routing, and firewall rules have not yet been configured.

